<title>HONG KONG: ONFEM in China expressway venture.</title>
<headline>ONFEM in China expressway venture.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ONFEM Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it has bought a five percent stake in Greater Beijing Region Expressway Limited (GBRE) for HK$200 million.</p>
<p>The sum would be raised partly by internal resources and the rest by bank borrowing, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>GBRE is a consortium made up of Singapore, Hong Kong and mainland Chinese interests.</p>
<p>GBRE plans to have interest in 10 segments of national expressways from and around Beijing, totalling some 580 km (362.5 miles), the statement said.</p>
<p>More than 50 percent, or 310 km, have been completed and are in operation, and the remaining is scheduled for completion by end-1999, the statement said.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
